#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:16
msgid "Introduce of Arduino IDE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:20
msgid "**Verify**: Compile your code. Any syntax problem will be prompted with errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:22
msgid "**Upload**: Upload the code to your board. When you click the button, the RX and TX LEDs on the board will flicker fast and won't stop until the upload is done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:24
msgid "**Debug**: For line-by-line error checking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:26
msgid "**Select Board**: Quick setup board and port."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:28
msgid "**Serial Plotter**: Check the change of reading value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:30
msgid "**Serial Monitor**: Click the button and a window will appear. It receives the data sent from your control board. It is very useful for debugging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:32
msgid "**File**: Click the menu and a drop-down list will appear, including file creating, opening, saving, closing, some parameter configuring, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:34
msgid "**Edit**: Click the menu. On the drop-down list, there are some editing operations like **Cut**, **Copy**, **Paste**, **Find**, and so on, with their corresponding shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:36
msgid "**Sketch**: Includes operations like **Verify**, **Upload**, **Add** files, etc. A more important function is **Include Library** – where you can add libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:38
msgid "**Tool**: Includes some tools – the most frequently used Board (the board you use) and Port (the port your board is at). Every time you want to upload the code, you need to select or check them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:40
msgid "**Help**: If you're a beginner, you may check the options under the menu and get the help you need, including operations in IDE, introduction information, troubleshooting, code explanation, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:42
msgid "**Output Bar**: Switch the output tab here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:44
msgid "**Output Window**: Print information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:46
msgid "**Board and Port**: Here you can preview the board and port selected for code upload. You can select them again by **Tools** -> **Board** / **Port** if any is incorrect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:48
msgid "The editing area of the IDE. You can write code here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:50
msgid "**Sketchbook**: For managing sketch files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:52
msgid "**Board Manager**: For managing board driver."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:54
msgid "**Library Manager**: For managing your library files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:56
msgid "**Debug**: Help debugging code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/02_introduce_ide.rst:58
msgid "**Search**: Search the codes from your sketches."
msgstr ""
